  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mongolia: National Export Strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on the facilitation and design of a National Export Strategy (NES) for Mongolia, covering six (6) export sectors and four (4) functional strategies to be selected through consultations with country counterparts, as per the standard NES methodology.  The NES design process aims to support increased export competitiveness and diversification within a 5-year horizon. Specifically for Mongolia, which is self-funding the project, the NES will build on the country&#x2019;s Trade and Investment Roadmap (TIR), previously facilitated by ITC, and align to Mongolia&#x2019;s Vision 2050 and other strategic priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
